on for the eerie and the supernatural, they have transformed an ordinary space into a terrifying labyrinth of haunted rooms, dark corridors, and mysterious creatures that lurk around every corner.\nL43: As the masterminds of this frightful attraction, they combine creativity, storytelling, and a deep understanding of what truly scares people to craft an unforgettable experience.\nL44: Whether it’s an old mansion, a haunted asylum, or a cursed carnival, The  Werehouse owner’s attention to detail and dedication to creating the perfect atmosphere are what set their haunted house apart. With carefully designed sets, high-tech special effects, and live actors who bring terrifying characters to life, they ensure that every guest’s visit is filled with suspense, surprises, and plenty of scares.\nL45: Beyond the spooky decorations and heart-pounding thrills, the spook house owner is also a business leader, managing operations, safety, staffing, and marketing to ensure everything runs smoothly. Their goal is simple: to deliver a terrifying, yet thrilling experience where visitors can face their fears and have fun doing it.\nL46: \nL47: Show Less\nL48: ## Contact Us\nL49: \nL50: [Input]\nL51: \nL52: #### Drop us a line!\nL53: \nL54: [Input]Name\nL55: \nL56: [Input]Email*\nL57: \nL58: Attach Files\nL59: \nL60: [Input]Attachments (0)\nL61: \nL62: [Button: Send]\nL63: \nL64: This site is protected by reCAPTCHA and the Google cite5†Privacy Policy†policies.google.com and cite6†Terms of Service†policies.google.com apply.\nL65: \nL66: #### Better yet, see us in person!\nL67: \nL68: We love our customers, so feel free to visit during normal business hours.\nL69: \nL70: #### The Werehouse\nL71: \nL72: 3819 E20th St, Joplin Mo 64801\nL73: \nL74: 417-396-6094\nL75: #### Hours\nL76: \nL77: Mon  | Closed  |\nL78: Tue  | Closed  |\nL79: Wed  | Closed  |\nL80: Thu  | Closed  |\nL81: Fri  | 07:00 pm – 12:00 am  |\nL82: Sat  | 07:00 pm – 12:00 am  |\nL83: Sun  | Closed  |\nL84: \nL85: #