3.00\nL112: \nL113: cite33†SEE PRICING CALENDAR ▼ L114: \nL115: [Input]\nL116: [Input]\nL117: [Input]\nL118: [Input]\nL119: [Input]\nL120: [Input]\nL121: [Input]\nL122: \nL123: ### October Pricing\nL124: \nL125: cite32†BUY TICKETS ▲ L126: \nL127: ## Promotions, Events & Attractions\nL128: \nL129: Carolyn’s Fall Festival will run from September 19th through October 31st. To help you decide when to visit, check out a list of our upcoming Themed Weekends!\nL130: #### Musical Guest\nL131: \nL132: cite34†Image: Promotions, Events and Attractions L133: \nL134: ## Quick Answers Before You Visit\nL135: \nL136: Planning a day at Carolyn’s Pumpkin Patch? Here are a few quick answers to help you get ready for fall fun in Liberty, Missouri.\nL137: \nL138: ### Easy to Find\nL139: \nL140: Located in Liberty, Missouri, a short drive from the Kansas City area.\nL141: \nL142: cite3†Directions ► L143: \nL144: ### Family Fall Fun\nL145: \nL146: Pumpkins, attractions, rides, and outdoor fun for kids and families.\nL147: \nL148: cite4†Events ► L149: ### Group Events\nL150: \nL151: School tours, birthday parties, and corporate events available.\nL152: \nL153: cite10†Groups ► L154: \nL155: ### Plan Ahead\nL156: \nL157: Check tickets, hours, pricing, and directions before your visit.\nL158: \nL159: cite2†Hours & Pricing ► L160: \nL161: ## Book Your Group Events\nL162: \nL163: ### School Tours\nL164: \nL165: cite11†Book School Tours L166: \nL167: ### Birthday Parties\nL168: \nL169: cite14†Book Birthday Parties L170: \nL171: ### Corporate Events\nL172: \nL173: cite16†Book Corporate Events L174: \nL175: ## Questions We Get the Most\nL176: \nL177: ### Can I bring my Pet?\nL178: \nL179: No. Pets are not allowed at Carolyn’s Pumpkin Patch.\nL180: ### Does Admission Include a Pumpkin?\nL181: \nL182: No. Admission to Carolyn’s Pumpkin Patch does not include a pumpkin.\nL183: \nL184: ### Can I take Pictures inside the property?\nL185: \nL186: Yes. Guests are welcome to take personal photos while visiting Carolyn’s Pumpkin Patch.\nL187: \nL188: ### Does it Cost to Park?\nL189: \nL190: Parking is free at Carolyn’s Pumpkin Patch.\nL191: \nL192: ### Can I bring my own Stroller or Wagon?\nL193: \nL194: Yes. Guests are welcome to bring their own stroller or wagon.\nL195: ### Are there Diaper Changing Stations Available?\nL196: \nL197: Yes. Diaper changing stations are available in several locations around the property.\nL198: \nL199: cite22†See All FAQ’s L200: \nL201: ## From Working Farm to Fall Family Destination\nL202: \nL203: Raasch Farms is a year round working farm but for 7 weeks each fall, it is also the home of Carolyn’s Pumpkin Patch! Bring your family and friends to the farm for an experience you will never forget!\nL204: \nL205: ### Hours & Pricing\nL206: \nL207: We Look forward to Seeing You at the Farm!\nL208: \nL209: cite2†Hours & Pricing L210: ### Carolyn’s Pumpkin Patch\nL211: \nL212: Ready to Find Your Perfect Pumpkin at Carolyn’s?\nL213: \nL214: cite6†Pumpkin Patch L215: \nL216: ### Activities & Attractions\nL217: \nL218: We Have Dozens of Activities for the Whole Family!\nL219: \nL220: cite7†Explore Activities L221: \nL222: ### Group Events\nL223: \nL224: School Outings, Birthdays & Corporate Events!\nL225: \nL226: cite10†Book Group Events L227: \nL228: ## Buy tickets online and be ready for fall fun when you arrive.\nL229: \nL230: cite32†Buy Tickets Now L231: ## Plan Your Visit to Carolyn’s Pumpkin Patch\nL232: \nL233: Make the most of your trip to Carolyn’s Pumpkin Patch in Liberty, Missouri. Located just outside Kansas City, the patch offers a full day of fall fun with pumpkins, attractions, food, and seasonal activities for families, groups, and visitors of all ages.\nL234: \nL235: cite32†Buy Tickets L236: \nL237: cite2†Hours & Pricing L238: \nL239: cite3†Location & Directions L240: \nL241: cite22†View FAQ’s L242: * Pumpkin Patch With Pumpkins of All Shapes and Sizes\nL243: * Train 